message: "If you use StableAgent, please cite it with these metadata."
title: "StableAgent: Behavioral Stability Evaluation of Autonomous Software Engineering Agents"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/At-Walid/stableagent"
authors:
  - family-names: Attaoui
    given-names: Mohamed Oualid
    affiliation: LIRMM
    email: mohammed.attaoui@lirmm.fr
keywords:
  - software engineering agents
  - metamorphic testing
  - LLM evaluation
  - SWE-bench
abstract: >-
  StableAgent checks whether an autonomous software-engineering agent behaves the same way when
  the same issue is described in different words. It applies meaning-preserving transformations
  to SWE-bench Lite issues, runs the agent on the original and on every variant, and reports
  whether the outcome and the patch change. It ships a Streamlit GUI, a CLI and a replay mode that
  reproduces the ICSE 2027 pilot without an API key.
